  "body": "Tiny issue I noticed in the loop of https://wicg.github.io/urlpattern/#create-a-component-match-result, while working on an implementation:\r\n\r\n> 4. Let _index_ be 1.\r\n> 5. While _index_ is less than Get(execResult, \"length\"):\r\n> > 1. Let name be component’s group name list[_index_ − 1].\r\n> > 2. Let value be Get(execResult, ToString(_index_).\r\n> > 3. Set groups[name] to value.\r\n\r\n\r\n_index_ is never incremented, and the loop will never end.",
